The Dream implementation was extracted from the whale-qqbot project, snapshot
b02c7c5, including the thread-safe journal fix from 9585fc1. This repository has
its own initial history and contains no deployment secrets or runtime journal.

Compatibility patches include context from their respective upstream projects:

- compatibility/patches/dream-livingmemory.patch:
  gongzhudeng/astrbot_plugin_livingmemory, commit
  c486ed65c7d072344c698f83359098c1d4293c8d (2.7.0-gd.12), AGPL-3.0.
  Its upstream credits identify lxfight's LivingMemory v2.3.6 as its base.
  https://github.com/gongzhudeng/astrbot_plugin_livingmemory
  https://github.com/lxfight-s-Astrbot-Plugins/astrbot_plugin_livingmemory

- compatibility/patches/dream-maibot.patch:
  Mai-with-u/MaiBot, commit 2a9af62cec37035d29237acbe2cf3adceb700b27,
  GPL-3.0. The upstream license is preserved in LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt.
  https://github.com/Mai-with-u/MaiBot
  The upstream context in this patch retains its original license.

AstrBot (AGPL-3.0) and LivingMemory are external runtime dependencies.
Their full source is not vendored here. Preserve upstream notices and licenses
when building or distributing patched upstream artifacts. The build helper
reconstructs changed files from the pinned Git objects; it does not replace
the complete upstream corresponding source or license files.
